# 🏋️ FitPal AI - Smart Fitness & Nutrition Management System

An AI-powered full-stack fitness and nutrition platform built using Django + Machine Learning, designed to provide personalized workout recommendations, diet tracking, expert guidance, and real-time fitness management.

---

 🚀 Key Features

 👤 User Module
- Secure registration with OTP email verification
- Profile & health metric tracking (BMI calculation)
- View fitness image/video plans
- Join nutrition programs
- Track step-by-step progress
- Workout recommendation using Machine Learning
- Chat with Experts & Dieticians
- Submit feedback & ratings

---

 🧑‍🏫 Expert Module
- Upload fitness plans (Images & Videos)
- Create structured diet programs
- Monitor joined users progress
- Real-time chat with users
- Manage profile & content

---

 🥗 Dietician Module
- Registration with admin approval
- Create nutrition plans with steps/images
- Accept/Reject join requests
- Track user completion %
- Chat support with users
- Manage nutrition feedback

---

 🛠️ Admin Module
- Manage Users, Experts & Dieticians
- Approve / Reject accounts
- View all uploaded fitness content
- Monitor nutrition plans & feedback
- Full platform control dashboard

---

 🤖 Machine Learning Integration

 Workout Recommendation System
Uses a trained ML model to recommend personalized workouts based on:

- Age
- Gender
- Weight
- Height
- BMI
- Body Fat %
- Workout Frequency
- Experience Level

 ML Tools Used
- Scikit-learn
- NumPy
- Pickle Model Deployment

